---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | spousalsupportcalc.com';
const description = 'How spousalsupportcalc.com collects, uses, and shares visitor and lead information, including data shared with attorneys through our case-review tool.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: July 2026.</em></p>
  <p>spousalsupportcalc.com is operated by The Click Lab. We take privacy seriously and write our policy in plain language. Two separate things happen on this site: reading the calculator and guides (anonymous, nothing collected), and using the "Spousal Support" case-review form on the homepage (collects your contact information and shares it with attorneys). Only the second one involves your personal data.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>Calculator inputs are processed in your browser only &mdash; we don't transmit or store them. We use Google Analytics to understand which pages are popular; this collects general information like country and device type, not identifying information.</p>
  <p>If you fill out and submit the "Spousal Support" case-review form on this site, we collect the information you enter &mdash; typically your name, phone number, email address, and details about your situation &mdash; along with a timestamp and record of the consent language you agreed to. This is the only way personal information leaves your browser on this site. Submitting this form is always optional; you can use the calculator and read every guide without ever seeing or completing it.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>Google AdSense cookies serve ads based on your prior visits. Opt out via <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Ads Settings</a>.</p>
  <h2>Case-review form submissions &mdash; shared with attorneys</h2>
  <p><strong>If you submit the case-review form, your name, phone number, email address, and case details are shared with one or more attorneys or their agents licensed to practice in your jurisdiction, so they can evaluate your situation and contact you about it.</strong> The Click Lab Agency LLC, which operates spousalsupportcalc.com, is not a law firm, does not provide legal advice, and does not vet, endorse, or guarantee the attorneys in this network. Submitting the form does not create an attorney-client relationship with The Click Lab Agency LLC or with any attorney until and unless that attorney separately agrees to represent you. The Click Lab Agency LLC may be compensated for these referrals. This arrangement is disclosed on the form itself at the point of submission.</p>
  <p>By submitting the form, you separately consent to be contacted by phone, text, and email &mdash; including by automated dialing technology &mdash; by The Click Lab Agency LLC and the attorneys or agents your information is shared with. That consent is not required to use any other part of this site, and you can decline it by not submitting the form.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p><strong>The simplest opt-out is not to submit the case-review form.</strong> Nothing about your visit is shared with any attorney unless you complete and submit it yourself.</p>
  <p>If you've already submitted the form and want to stop being contacted, email <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a> with the subject line <code>[OPT-OUT]</code>, or visit <a href="https://theclicklab.agency/optout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">theclicklab.agency/optout</a>. We will notify the attorney or agent your information was shared with and remove you from further outreach on our end.</p>
  <p>For California residents: sharing your information with attorneys in exchange for compensation may constitute a "sale" or "share" of personal information under the CCPA/CPRA. You have the right to opt out of that sale/share &mdash; the easiest way is not submitting the case-review form; to exercise this right after submission, email <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a> with the subject line <code>[CCPA OPT-OUT]</code>. We do not sell or share data collected only through anonymous site browsing (i.e., if you never submit the form).</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>EU/UK/California residents have rights to access, correct, or delete personal data. For anonymous browsing, there's typically nothing to access since we don't collect identifying data. For case-review form data, the legal basis for processing is your consent, given at the point of submission, which you can withdraw at any time by emailing us. Contact us via <a href="/contact">our contact page</a> or <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a> with the subject line <code>[PRIVACY REQUEST]</code>.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>Material changes announced via banner on the homepage.</p>
</BaseLayout>
